        "thumb": "https://n.sinaimg.cn/translate/w485h335/20180131/s50R-fyrcsrv9873038.jpg",
        "time": "2018-02-01 10:35:00",
        "title": "\u003cfont color='red'\u003e江西铜业\u003c/font\u003e(00358-HK)获花旗集团增持170.79万股",
        "type": 0,
